{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49331","headline":"河传 二 · 韦庄","name":"河传 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春晚，风暖。\n锦城花满，狂杀游人。\n玉鞭金勒寻胜，驰骤轻尘，惜良辰。\n翠蛾争劝临邛酒，纤纤手，拂面垂丝柳。\n归时烟里钟鼓，正是黄昏，暗销魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}